## E. Pre-commit hook (opsional tapi sangat dianjurkan)

Buat `.git/hooks/pre-commit`:

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Mencegah commit jika ada pelanggaran fatal.
make lint
```

Atau pakai `pre-commit` framework dengan `.pre-commit-config.yaml`:

```yaml
repos:
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: itb-lint
        name: ITB format lint
        entry: bash scripts/lint-itb.sh
        language: system
        files: ^(chapters/.*\.tex|disertasi\.tex)$
      - id: chktex
        name: chktex
        entry: chktex -q -n8 -n24
        language: system
        files: \.tex$
```

